  "sourceTitle": "Tomato and Celery Relish",
  "sourceText": "Tomato and Celery Relish\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Friday, December 11, 2009 - 11:57pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 onion finely chopped\nfinely chopped\n1 tablespoon salt\n1 large green pepper\n2 tablespoons sugar\n1 large bunch celery\n2 allspice berries\n1/2 cup canned or fresh tomatoes\n2/3 cup vinegar\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Mix ingredients, heat gradually to the boiling-point, and cook slowly one and one-half hours. Cayenne or mustard may be added if liked more highly seasoned.",
